{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56716","headline":"洞灵宫（题拟） · 无名氏","name":"洞灵宫（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洞灵源接洞阳天，瘦（《沅湘耆旧集》卷十三作「疲」）壑危峰吐绦烟。\n曾踏落花听玉籁（《沅湘耆旧集》作「笛」），赤松坛畔鹤鸣泉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56716.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56716","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}